<h2>AgentAwake 0.9.1 beta</h2>
<p>Thank you for testing. This beta works until the date shown in the AgentAwake menu; updates arrive by themselves.</p>
<ul>
  <li>Keeps your Mac awake, even with the lid closed, while Claude Code, Codex and opencode work.</li>
  <li>Welcome window: set up in two clicks and one password.</li>
  <li>Report a problem… in the menu sends us what we need to fix it.</li>
</ul>
